{{see also|Idaho's 2nd congressional district}}
The 2nd district encompasses eastern and northern [[Boise]], as well as [[Eastern Idaho]]. The incumbent was Republican [[Mike Simpson]], who was re-elected with 64.1% of the vote in 2020.<ref name="HPVT"/>

